Checking out five debug-generated guardian nagas, the moment they
showed up; two weren't carrying anything, but the others probed as:

The guardian naga's possessions:

Potions
a - a potion of full healing
[...]
The guardian naga's possessions:

Scrolls
a - a scroll labeled KERNOD WEL
[...]
The guardian naga's possessions:

Wands
a - a platinum wand

Each of these also produced a death drop. But nagas _can_ come with
item-user equipment (both scroll and wand turned out to be
teleportation), although they'll never use it. 

